# Commands
## Delay shuttle round end
cmd-delayroundend-desc = 停止紧急穿梭机离开超空间时结束回合的计时器。
cmd-delayroundend-help = 用法：delayroundend
emergency-shuttle-command-round-yes = 回合已延迟。
emergency-shuttle-command-round-no = 无法延迟回合结束。

## Dock emergency shuttle
cmd-dockemergencyshuttle-desc = 呼叫紧急穿梭机并将其对接至空间站……如果可以的话。
cmd-dockemergencyshuttle-help = 用法：dockemergencyshuttle

## Launch emergency shuttle
cmd-launchemergencyshuttle-desc = 如有可能，提前发射紧急穿梭机。
cmd-launchemergencyshuttle-help = 用法：launchemergencyshuttle

# Emergency shuttle
emergency-shuttle-left = 紧急穿梭机已离开空间站。预计{$transitTime}秒后抵达中央指挥部。
emergency-shuttle-launch-time = 紧急穿梭机将在{$consoleAccumulator}秒后发射。
emergency-shuttle-docked = 紧急穿梭机已对接在空间站{$direction}，{$location}。它将在{$time}秒后离开。{$extended}
emergency-shuttle-good-luck = 紧急穿梭机找不到空间站。祝你好运。
emergency-shuttle-nearby = 紧急穿梭机找不到有效的对接口。它已折跃至空间站{$direction}，{$location}。它将在{$time}秒后离开。{$extended}
emergency-shuttle-extended = {" "}由于不便的情况，发射时间已被延长。

